
- 8 orders have the status `delivered` but no delivery date. Seven of them have a\
  carrier handover date, one has neither. They are excluded from the delivery\
  time calculation.\
- 6 `canceled` orders have a delivery date. They are kept in the data, and the\
  reason is unknown.\
- Delivery time and the share of late deliveries are calculated only for orders\
  with a delivery date. Orders without one are not counted as "on time".
  
  - 288 delivered orders (about 0.3%) took more than 60 days. Several of the
  slowest ones have the same delivery date (19 Sep 2017), so the date may have
  been entered in bulk. These orders are kept in the data.